{"data":{"body":"[P2] Add coverage for the new serialization option. Existing tests exercise `generateTemplate()` but never invoke `yaml.dump()` or `main()`, so an invalid or behavior-changing option can silently rewrite `template.yml` without failing CI. Extract the serialization into an exported helper and unit-test that values requiring quotes are emitted with double quotes, or compare the generated YAML with the checked-in template.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs79gJNe","finding_digest":"95fd89c8b00eb50af19539b9352c0e250e9118e6e295d7159f37368332aaaaa8","finding_id":"arf_v1_sx6ytsfqb22qv4mvhg4tklaoeu","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/scripts/generate-sam-template.ts::main::yaml-serialization-test-coverage","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/scripts/generate-sam-template.ts::main::yaml-serialization-test-coverage","line":370,"observation_digest":"ee10cca84601e90e20dc2b9df6ea8113380aa2c037ace9212df01a6d7c910a71","observation_id":"aro_v1_5yimzkcgahuq4ig4foo7n2ubcm","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/scripts/generate-sam-template.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-12T22:57:18Z","review_id":"arr_v1_jup53e2njvxo3rw5ayttb4ukkc","reviewed_base_sha":"571858c7fe344824427303b51f4f673fe7467c91","reviewed_head_sha":"c293a2feee569ab354760af6341920acb1bca826","reviewer":"codex","start_line":370,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":992},"record_id":"art_v1_dwtfonmh5wrzrb7vbbv7ojbjhv","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-12T22:57:18Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
